# Simulation

No `pixi.js` imports. `World` is Maps of asteroids, trees, seedlings, pending plants. New entities use `allocId`.

Ownership:

- `world.ts` `tick()` — growth, spawn, travel, energy, upkeep, tree burn
- `commands.ts` — player/AI intent (`sendSeedlings`, `plantTree`); returns `CommandResult`
- `combat.ts` — `resolveCombat` only
- `ai.ts` — enemy empire via commands; do not duplicate combat or tick
- `layout.ts` — map setup; travel graph must stay connected
- `graph.ts` — reachability / shortest path
- `lsystem.ts` — tree geometry for tips/planting, not game rules

Travel uses outbound `travelRadius`. Combat is mass + type (`basic` vs `sentinel`). Capture: clear garrison, burn enemy trees, then plant (`PLANT_COST` orbiters).
